Logos in this folder

These small images are example art in the Inbox's one-time "Choose how your list looks" dialog. They draw an
example Inbox window with well-known open-source projects in it. They are used nowhere else.

plannotator.webp is Plannotator's own mark.

The other files are the GitHub profile pictures of these organizations, from https://github.com/<organization>.png,
made smaller and saved as WebP:

  oven-sh.webp          oven-sh (Bun)
  supabase.webp         supabase (Supabase)
  vitejs.webp           vitejs (Vite)
  docker.webp           docker (Docker)
  zed-industries.webp   zed-industries (Zed)
  huggingface.webp      huggingface (Hugging Face)
  redis.webp            redis (Redis)
  vercel.webp           vercel (Vercel, Next.js)

